## Proposed Changes

### Database & Models

#### [MODIFY] [sticky_note.py](file:///c:/Users/yuuya/Documents/dev/wl-board-pj/board-system/backend/app/models/sticky_note.py)
- `due_date` カラム (Date型, nullable=True) を追加。

#### [MODIFY] [board_placement.py](file:///c:/Users/yuuya/Documents/dev/wl-board-pj/board-system/backend/app/models/board_placement.py)
- `is_manually_moved_to_today` カラム (Boolean型, default=False, nullable=False) を追加。

### Schemas & APIs

